out/

# ── 2026-10-27 统一范式补全（与 techdou 仓 .gitignore 标准对齐）──

# ── 私密信息与密钥：绝不入库 ──
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets*
credentials*
*.token
_htpasswd


